{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2077","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Binary Subsequence Value Sum"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l_fXX3Y0Pis"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Last | Moment - onoken"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For a binary string$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$ $$$v$$$, the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"score"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of $$$v$$$ is defined as the maximum value of "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$$$$F\\big(v, 1, i\\big) \\cdot F\\big(v, i+1, |v|\\big)$$$$$$ "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"over all $$$i$$$ ($$$0 \\leq i \\leq |v|$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here, $$$F\\big(v, l, r\\big) = r - l + 1 - 2 \\cdot \\operatorname{zero}(v, l, r)$$$, where $$$\\operatorname{zero}(v, l, r)$$$ denotes the number of $$$\\mathtt{0}$$$s in $$$v_lv_{l+1} \\ldots v_r$$$. If $$$l \\gt r$$$, then $$$F\\big(v, l, r\\big) = 0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a binary string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$ and a positive integer $$$q$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You will be asked $$$q$$$ queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In each query, you are given an integer $$$i$$$ ($$$1 \\leq i \\leq n$$$). You must flip $$$s_i$$$ from $$$\\mathtt{0}$$$ to $$$\\mathtt{1}$$$ (or from $$$\\mathtt{1}$$$ to $$$\\mathtt{0}$$$). Find the sum of the scores over all non-empty subsequences$$$^{\\text{†}}$$$ of $$$s$$$ after each modification query. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Since the result may be large, output the answer modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that the modifications are persistent."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$A binary string is a string that consists only of the characters $$$\\mathtt{0}$$$ and $$$\\mathtt{1}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\text{†}}$$$A binary string $$$x$$$ is a subsequence of a binary string $$$y$$$ if $$$x$$$ can be obtained from $$$y$$$ by deleting several (possibly zero or all) characters."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$1 \\leq q \\leq 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the length of the string $$$s$$$ and the number of modification queries, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains the binary string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$, consisting of characters $$$\\mathtt{0}$$$ and $$$\\mathtt{1}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following $$$q$$$ lines each contain an integer $$$i$$$ ($$$1 \\leq i \\leq n$$$), indicating that $$$s_i$$$ is flipped from $$$\\mathtt{0}$$$ to $$$\\mathtt{1}$$$ or from $$$\\mathtt{1}$$$ to $$$\\mathtt{0}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that neither the total sum of all values of $$$n$$$ nor the total sum of all values of $$$q$$$ across all test cases exceeds $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output $$$q$$$ lines, each line containing a single integer — the required sum modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n3 2\n010\n1\n3\n10 3\n0101000110\n3\n5\n10\n24 1\n011001100110000101111000\n24\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n5\n512\n768\n1536\n23068672\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first test case, after the first modification, we have $$$s = \\texttt{110}$$$. We can compute the sum of scores over all subsequences as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Indices"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sub